{"text": "Ani's teacher gives every child a small pot with a seed in it. 'Water it a little every day and put it in the sun,' she says. At home, Ani puts the pot on the kitchen window. For a week nothing happens, and Ani feels sad. Then one morning she sees a tiny green leaf! Every day the plant grows a little taller. Ani learns an important lesson: good things need time. Now she writes the plant's height in her notebook every Sunday.", "words": [[0.18, 0.54], [0.62, 1.04], [1.14, 1.38], [1.54, 1.86], [1.96, 2.4], [2.46, 2.49], [2.58, 2.92], [2.98, 3.3], [3.5, 3.64], [3.68, 3.71], [3.8, 4.08], [4.14, 4.22], [4.28, 4.4], [4.58, 5.78], [5.84, 5.92], [5.98, 6.01], [6.06, 6.34], [6.42, 6.64], [6.72, 6.96], [7.08, 7.2], [7.26, 7.42], [7.48, 7.56], [7.6, 7.68], [7.7, 7.8], [7.88, 8.24], [8.26, 8.36], [8.46, 8.78], [9.78, 9.92], [10.04, 10.38], [10.8, 11.06], [11.14, 11.4], [11.44, 11.52], [11.56, 11.86], [11.92, 12.0], [12.02, 12.1], [12.14, 12.5], [12.56, 12.96], [13.94, 14.06], [14.12, 14.15], [14.22, 14.5], [14.66, 14.98], [15.04, 15.48], [15.72, 15.84], [15.94, 16.14], [16.26, 16.56], [16.66, 17.08], [18.04, 18.26], [18.44, 18.58], [18.64, 19.08], [19.22, 19.32], [19.46, 19.74], [19.78, 19.81], [19.92, 20.34], [20.48, 20.84], [20.96, 21.22], [22.18, 22.48], [22.58, 22.86], [23.02, 23.1], [23.18, 23.64], [23.74, 24.08], [24.14, 24.17], [24.24, 24.48], [24.58, 25.02], [26.06, 26.28], [26.42, 26.8], [26.84, 26.92], [26.96, 27.56], [27.62, 28.0], [28.44, 28.62], [28.72, 29.14], [29.28, 29.52], [29.6, 30.08], [31.14, 31.4], [31.52, 31.62], [31.72, 32.06], [32.12, 32.2], [32.24, 32.6], [32.7, 33.0], [33.1, 33.18], [33.24, 33.36], [33.42, 33.84], [33.96, 34.2], [34.3, 34.865]], "tag": "chatterbox:sonia", "pace": "v2-slow", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc2", "clamped": 1}